				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				6
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Rename module files from snake_case to PascalCase\n\nAlign all Grove module filenames with the project's PascalCase naming convention as specified in CLAUDE.md. Rename types.rs→Types.rs, vscode.rs→VSCode.rs, error.rs→Error.rs, and traits.rs→Traits.rs. Update module declarations in mod.rs files to use #[path] attributes and update all import paths to reference the new PascalCase module names.\n\nThis maintains code functionality while enforcing consistent naming across the codebase.",
			"SHA": "3305757b6181ba3941b0b8db4ce6a243fa7c27c5"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
